WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
New report: Corelata asks which project the report is for.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.900
A new project, "Varna port".

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.000
Its source, varna-port.txt, is uploaded and selected.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.800
The value statement: what the report is for and why it matters.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.000
Write the report. The run goes through its steps unattended; on the synthetic test model it takes under a second.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.700
The finished report, ready to review.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.500
Claims: choosing a claim highlights it in the report and lists its evidence.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.300
Standards: the auditor's verdict on every rule of the pack.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.100
Sources: each source with its SHA-256, and the pack the report was checked against.
